  <div class="story__identity">
<h1 class="story__identity-title">Good Girl Walks Away, Leaving the Capital#*#s Playboy Seeing Red</h1><div class="story__identity-meta">by <a href='https://www.asianovel.net/author/202603126245/' class='author '>喵总睡不醒</a></div></div>

</header>

      <section class="story__summary content-section"><p>&#8220;Hedonist Playboy × Clear-Minded Good Girl | The High-and-Mighty Bows His Head | A Hellish Pursuit to Win Her Back&#8221;</p>
<p>He was the ungraspable wind; she was the willow, quiet and self-contained.</p>
<p>A game that began with &#8220;just for fun&#8221; ended with a casual &#8220;I&#8217;m bored.&#8221;</p>
<p>Everyone said the rule-following good girl was crazy about the most unrestrained playboy in the capital&#8217;s elite circle—</p>
<p>He didn&#8217;t want to marry, she nodded; he hated constraints, she stayed silent.</p>
<p>All his rebellious demands, she accepted without a word.</p>
<p>Until he casually mentioned breaking up, and she only replied with a single &#8220;Okay,&#8221; leaving without a backward glance.</p>
<p>When they met again, she was discussing marriage with someone else, her eyes shining with a light he&#8217;d never seen.</p>
<p>Only then did the realization hit Ling Jue—</p>
<p>Her past compliance was only because she had never included him in her future.</p>
<p>Later, for the first time, the high-and-mighty playboy&#8217;s eyes grew red-rimmed, trembling in the darkness as he grabbed the hem of her clothes:</p>
<p>&#8220;Qin Shuyi&#8230; please look back at me.&#8221;</p>
<p>&#8220;I&#8217;m not tainted anymore, really.&#8221;</p>
<p>—In this game, whoever falls in love first loses completely.</p>
